#: scenario7:scenario7_BACD08A1_9263_4A2D_8B26_1FF261B8F58D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 213779c9089c0f98b02f3e1b22b3fdd97c0099a2e318ddf2c517bd16c2ba3b30
#. default-sha256: 705d2a91be257c2356229bd0efda696d8986195918843c104e3faddce59668d8
